<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss govt sets auction for 3-1/2 pct 13-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Swiss govt sets auction for 3-1/2 pct 13-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced</p>
<p>by the Swiss National Bank on behalf of the Swiss Treasury.</p>
<p>BORROWER - Swiss Government</p>
<p> AMT  max 1 bln CHF   COUPON     3-1/2     MATURITY   07.Aug.10</p>
<p> PAY FREQ annual	ISS PRICE  =	   PAY DATE   07.Aug.97</p>
<p> LOCAL CODE 680 990				ACCRUAL    07.Aug.97</p>
<p>Note = Subscriptions end on June 24. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
